boundary='Actual public18 proofs and25canaries compile locally. The learner and support policy are fixed exogenous deterministic finite-history parameters. Comparison uses the same actual vector-feedback trajectory; a universal OLO performance bound is an input to transport, not a guarantee produced for arbitrary learners. Feasible/canonical adapters implement OCO. Randomized laws, measurability, independence and executable choice are separate. Package/root/harness/reader acceptance and PR delivery have their own evidence. Chapter2, older26production migration and Chapters3-16 remain required; no merged/live update.'
